# SG4 - Understanding Classes and Objects
## Class Name: Song
## Class Description: A 3 minute rock song.

## Properties
+------------------+-----------+---------------------------------+
|     Property     | Data Type |           Description           |
+------------------+-----------+---------------------------------+
| Title            |  string   | Title of the song               |
| Artist           |  string   | Name of the artist              |
| Explicit rating  |  boolean  | If the song is explicit         |
| Minutes          |  int      | Duration of the song in minutes |
| Genre            |  string   | Genre of the song               |
+------------------+-----------+---------------------------------+

## Methods

+----------+-----------------------------------------+
|  Method  |              Description                |
+----------+-----------------------------------------+
| play     | plays the song                          |
| pause    | pauses the song                         |
| playback | plays the song again                    |
| repeat   | repeats the song an x amount of times   |
+----------+-----------------------------------------+

