## Design Explanation
### Why did you choose this class?
  Songs have easily identifiable properties and methods that can be expressed or describes in a UML format.

### Which property is the most important? Why?
  The Title is the most important property because its the primary identity of the class.

### Which method is the most useful? Why?
  The most useful method is Play because it fullfills the primary purpose of the class which is to be played.
